flowchart LR
    CH[Channel Adapters] -->|canonical inbound event| CV[Conversation Management]
    CV -->|new turn command| AI[AI Conversation Engine]
    AI -->|retrieval request| KB[Knowledge and RAG]
    KB -->|ranked passages + source IDs| AI
    AI -->|typed tool request| TS[Tool Execution Service]
    TS -->|authorized operation| INT[Integration Adapters]
    INT -->|typed result| TS
    TS -->|tool result| AI
    AI -->|final response + metadata| CV
    CV -->|delivery command| CH
    AI -->|handoff request| HI[Human Inbox]
    HI -->|ownership event| CV
    CV -->|domain events| BUS[Durable Queue / Outbox]
    BUS --> ANA[Analytics and Evaluation]
    BUS --> NOTIF[Notifications / Workflows]
    SEC[Security, Audit, Observability] -.cross-cutting.-> CH
    SEC -.cross-cutting.-> CV
    SEC -.cross-cutting.-> AI
    SEC -.cross-cutting.-> TS
